---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../utils/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Integrity hotline — ${SITE.name}`}
  description="Report integrity concerns to Merstat's independent integrity line."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <h1>Integrity hotline</h1>
      <p>
        Merstat operates an independent integrity line for raising concerns about fraud, corruption,
        harassment, discrimination, safeguarding failures, or other misconduct.
      </p>

      <h2>How to report</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> with the subject "Integrity". Your report
        is received by the Director and treated as confidential.
      </p>

      <h2>What happens next</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>You receive an acknowledgement within 5 working days.</li>
        <li>The Director reviews the report and decides on next steps.</li>
        <li>If an investigation is needed, an independent investigator is appointed.</li>
        <li>You are updated on outcome (subject to confidentiality).</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Whistleblower protection</h2>
      <p>
        Retaliation against anyone who reports in good faith is a serious breach of policy and will
        result in disciplinary action up to and including dismissal. We support and protect
        whistleblowers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
